{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42232","headline":"谪居舒州累得韩高二舍人书作此寄之 · 徐铉","name":"谪居舒州累得韩高二舍人书作此寄之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三峰烟霭碧临谿，中有骚人理钓丝。\n会友少於分袂日，谪居多却在朝时。\n丹心历历吾终信，俗虑悠悠尔不知。\n珍重韩君与高子，殷勤书札寄相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}